              "title": "Write the formula",
              "md": "$E_k = \\tfrac{1}{2} m v^2$"
            },
            {
              "title": "Fill in",
              "md": "$\\tfrac{1}{2} \\cdot 1000 \\cdot 20^2 = 200\\,000$ J"
